lated (topped early) (investor cycle week 20 \u00b7 daily cycle day 11).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): nearing a low. Bigger picture (no clear trend): mixed.", "synthesis_line": "", "synthesis_line_zh": "", "points": ["Bigger picture is mixed (no clear trend for a daily long)", "Swing low printed (buyers rejected the low)", "Still below the 10-day average", "Prior cycle topped early (a tiring-trend hint)"], "entry": {"tag": "WAIT", "tag_zh": "\u7b49\u5f85", "urgency": "later", "days_lo": 25, "days_hi": 31, "text": "A normal mid-cycle dip below the 10-day average \u2014 the real cycle low isn't due for ~25+ trading days. Wait for support to hold, or for the next low to set up.", "text_zh": "\u8fd9\u662f\u8dcc\u7834 10 \u65e5\u5747\u7ebf\u7684\u6b63\u5e38\u5468\u671f\u4e2d\u6bb5\u56de\u8c03\u2014\u2014\u771f\u6b63\u7684\u5468\u671f\u4f4e\u70b9\u8981\u5230\u7ea6 25+ \u4e2a\u4ea4\u6613\u65e5\u540e\u624d\u4f1a\u5230\u6765\u3002\u7b49\u5f85\u652f\u6491\u7ad9\u7a33\uff0c\u6216\u7b49\u4e0b\u4e00\u4e2a\u4f4e\u70b9\u6784\u7b51\u6210\u5f62\u3002"}, "cycle_plain": {"daily_line": "Daily cycle: day 11 of a typical 36\u201342 trading days", "daily_phase": "fresh \u2014 a new cycle just started", "daily_line_zh": "\u65e5\u7ebf\u5468\u671f\uff1a\u7b2c 11 \u5929\uff0c\u5178\u578b\u5468\u671f\u4e3a 36\u201342 \u4e2a\u4ea4\u6613\u65e5", "daily_phase_zh": "\u5168\u65b0\u2014\u2014\u65b0\u5468\u671f\u521a\u521a\u542f\u52a8", "weekly_line": "Weekly (investor) cycle: week 20 of a typical 16\u201326 weeks", "weekly_phase": "late \u2014 the bigger cycle is getting old", "weekly_line_zh": "\u5468\u7ebf\uff08\u6295\u8d44\u8005\uff09\u5468\u671f\uff1a\u7b2c 20 \u5468\uff0c\u5178\u578b\u5468\u671f\u4e3a 16\u201326 \u5468", "weekly_phase_zh": "\u665a\u671f\u2014\u2014\u66f4\u5927\u7684\u5468\u671f\u5df2\u8d8b\u4e8e\u8001\u5316", "translation": "The last cycle peaked in its FIRST half ('left-translated') \u2014 weak cycles top early, so this hints the bigger trend is tiring.", "translatio